# Route: guide 8 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 27 to
# 28, 13 quests, 1.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stonetalon Mountains): Sun Rock Retreat -> Webwinder Path -> Windshear
# Crag -> Webwinder Path -> Mirkfallon Lake -> Stonetalon Peak -> The Charred
# Vale -> Stonetalon Peak.
